      "text": "物理机安装操作系统并配置 / 配置netplan bond0口与bond0子接口（虚拟机跳过该步骤） / netplan非Bond模式（实验室内部使用）\n# This is the network config written by 'subiquity'\nnetwork:\n  ethernets:\n    ens16f0:\n      addresses:\n      - 172.16.100.50/24             # 用于K8s地址\n      gateway4: 172.16.100.1\n      nameservers:                 # DNS 服务器地址\n        addresses:\n        - 114.114.114.114\n        - 172.16.100.1\n        search: []\n      routes:\n      - to: default\n        via: 172.16.100.1\n    ens16f1:\n      dhcp4: no                    # 用于UPF N4地址\n    ens16f2:\n      dhcp4: no\n    ens16f3:\n      dhcp4: no\n    ens1f0:                         # 可用于UPF N6地址 \n      dhcp4: no\n    ens1f1:                         # 可用于UPF N3地址\n      dhcp4: no\n    ens3f0:\n      dhcp4: no\n    ens3f1:\n      dhcp4: no\n  version: 2",
